        "spans": [[4, 23]],
        "groups": {
          "volume": "85",
          "page": "12,345"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "The court relied on 89 Fed. Reg. 1 (Jan. 2, 2024) in reaching its holding.",
        "spans": [[20, 34]]
      },
      {
