  "measured": {
    "precision": "unmeasured"
  },
  "note": "url_templates: govinfo link service, verified by HTTP fetch on 2026-10-23: https://www.govinfo.gov/link/fr/85/12345 redirects to the FR-2020-03-02 PDF at that page (also 88/1000 and 60/5000); a comma page answers 400, so the template and the key use {page|digits} (`12,345` and `12345` are one authority). federalregister.gov sends scripts to a bot check: decoder only. lcr-53x: pin and page ranges accept a hyphen, en dash (U+2013), figure dash (U+2012) or em dash."
}
